o7a_text","default":"<p>\"Stress used to get the best of me – I’d feel overwhelmed and burnt out halfway through the day. Since starting Shilajit Shockwave, I’ve noticed a complete shift. Not only do I have more energy, but I also feel more centered and calm when things get hectic. It’s become a part of my daily routine, and I can’t imagine starting my day without it. The fact that it’s natural and so easy to take makes it even better!\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggh5z7nzDt__text","label":"ggh5z7nzDt__text","default":"Dr L. 25"},{"type":"html","id":"ggksKa-fMRg_text","label":"ggksKa-fMRg_text","default":"<p>\"I’ve been struggling with fatigue for years, trying everything from energy drinks to different diets. Nothing worked until I found Shilajit Shockwave. Now, I wake up excited to start my day. My mental clarity has improved dramatically, and I no longer need naps to get through the afternoon. I’m more productive at work and happier at home. This product has truly changed my life!\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggX71RrKW3F_text","label":"ggX71RrKW3F_text","default":"&nbsp;Evelyn M. 58"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBPL-M0sLA_text","label":"ggBPL-M0sLA_text","default":"<p>\"I’m in my 50s and have been feeling like my brain is in a fog most days. I started using Shilajit Shockwave three weeks ago, and I can’t believe how sharp I feel now. My focus at work has improved dramatically, and I’m not forgetting little things anymore. I take it in the morning, and it keeps me alert and calm throughout the day. I feel like I’ve got my brain back!\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggC1b9Jc_Fn_label","label":"ggC1b9Jc_Fn_label","default":"<p>UNLOCK MY POTENTIAL NOW 👉🏻</p>"}],
